<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Welcome!</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
        .header { background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 10px 0; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
        .content { padding: 20px; }
        .footer { margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; color: #888888; font-size: 0.8em; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Welcome, {{name}}!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
            <p>Thank you for joining our service. We are excited to have you on board!</p>
            <p>Your username is: <strong>{{username}}</strong></p>
            <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact us.</p>
            <p>Best regards,</p>
            <p>The Melanie Notification Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{year}} Melanie Notification. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
